  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "AkulinaTarasova",
      "content": "This series makes you think about how the past influences the present, it has nothing to do with religion or strange beliefs, personally it has helped me understand many things that have happened to me in the present and past and I have coincidentally recognized that some of my ancestors have experienced the same, they are like cycles. The series has helped me a lot to understand, accept and comprehend that these cycles can be broken. It is based on the theory and therapy of a German psychologist, the idea is not invented. The performances are unbeatable, especially the main protagonist, played by the famous actress Tuba Buyukustun.",
